#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:7
#: e2a643ef7ab54c379d97d65ceec3c5ee
msgid "Serial Passthrough"
msgstr "串行透传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:9
#: dcf0db3cb18c4c2bbef7ded34cf0d0cf
msgid ""
"\"Serial Passthrough\" allows the autopilot to route serial protocol "
"messages between serial ports on the autopilot including the USB port.  This"
" can be used to configure a sensors or devices (which have a serial "
"interface) without disconnecting it from the autopilot using a USB "
"connection. It is also possible to pass data from any serial port to another"
" serial port."
msgstr ""
"「串行透传」允许飞控在飞控上的串行端口（包括USB端口）之间路由串行协议消息。这可用于在不断开连接的情况下通过USB连接配置具有串行接口的传感器或设备。也可以将数据从任意串行端口传递到另一个串行端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:12
#: a2ae91d58e4d4215b6ae54bc3c639fba
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:14
#: 9d29155cb7544160999e5a4d530b1c7b
msgid ""
"The sensor or device (with a serial interface) should already be connected "
"to one of the autopilot's serial ports.  Ideally it should already be "
"working."
msgstr "传感器或设备（具有串行接口）应已连接到飞控的某个串行端口，最好已能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:15
#: f569cbb609a94e34ad521ba4a8d8e9c2
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot to a PC using a USB cable and connect with a Ground "
"Station (i.e. Mission Planner, QGC, etc)."
msgstr "使用USB电缆将飞控连接到PC，并通过地面站（即Mission Planner、QGC等）连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:17
#: 8a021614b62e45acab54950602bfe9f2
msgid ""
"On most F7 and H7 boards, a second USB virtual serial port also appears when"
" you connect via USB to the autopilot and is assigned the last SERIALx port "
"in ArduPilot for SLCAN use. This can also be used for serial device "
"configuration by changing :ref:`SERIAL_PASS1<SERIAL_PASS1>` to that port's "
"number. This allows the autopilot to remain connected to a Ground Control "
"Station, and still use passthrough to a sensor for configuration "
"simultaneously on the PC via its configuration program."
msgstr ""
"在大多数F7和H7飞控板上，通过USB连接时会出现第二个USB虚拟串行端口，并在ArduPilot中分配为最后一个SERIALx端口供SLCAN使用。也可以通过将"
" :ref:`SERIAL_PASS1<SERIAL_PASS1>` "
"更改为该端口编号来用于串行设备配置。这允许飞控保持与地面站的连接，同时在PC上通过其配置程序同时使用透传对传感器进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:19
#: ebed18956a54467a9aa9afb607b0fb77
msgid ""
"Its best if the sensor already can be detected and used by ArduPilot first."
msgstr "最好先确认传感器已能被ArduPilot检测和使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:20
#: 0314026893b845e6850614bea733b83e
msgid ""
"Be sure to set each port's baud rate appropriately using the "
"``SERIALx_BAUD`` parameters (USB ports automatically use the passthrough "
"port's baud rate and do not need to be changed). The rates may be different "
"for each port. ArduPilot will do the buffering.  For example, if attempting "
"passthrough to the first GPS, :ref:`SERIAL3_BAUD <SERIAL3_BAUD>` should "
"normally be set to 230400 but you may check the GPS driver's \"autobauding\""
" by looking at the ground stations Message window soon after startup. "
"Additionally, many sensor drivers ignore what is set for this parameter, "
"since its hardcoded in the driver, but it MUST be set when using the "
"passthrough feature."
msgstr ""
"务必使用 ``SERIALx_BAUD`` "
"参数为每个端口设置适当的波特率（USB端口自动使用透传端口的波特率，无需更改）。每个端口的速率可以不同，ArduPilot将进行缓冲处理。例如，如果尝试透传到第一个GPS，:ref:`SERIAL3_BAUD"
" <SERIAL3_BAUD>` "
"通常应设置为230400，但您可以在启动后不久通过查看地面站消息窗口来检查GPS驱动程序的「自动波特率」。此外，许多传感器驱动程序会忽略此参数的设置（因为驱动程序中已硬编码），但使用透传功能时必须设置此参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:26
#: ee5da16229b1417cb4f4ca5162e9ad29
msgid ""
"The default for :ref:`SERIAL_PASS1<SERIAL_PASS1>` (the first serial port to "
"be interconnected) defaults to SERIAL0, the primary USB port."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL_PASS1<SERIAL_PASS1>` （第一个互联的串行端口）默认为SERIAL0，即主USB端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:27
#: 56ae3b4192cd4b69bfd6e73fe7dfa745
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL_PASSTIMO <SERIAL_PASSTIMO>` timeout to a length of time (in"
" seconds) that gives you enough time to connect with the sensor's "
"configuration software. 30 to 60 seconds is a good choice but setting it to "
"zero will remain in passthrough until reboot occurs."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL_PASSTIMO <SERIAL_PASSTIMO>` "
"超时设置为足够您连接传感器配置软件的时间（以秒为单位）。30至60秒是个好选择，但设置为零将保持透传状态直至重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:28
#: 5c61e3dd415140248d1c8e657d343b5d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL_PASS2 <SERIAL_PASS2>` to the number of the serial port "
"connected to the sensor.  I.e. \"2\" if the sensor is connected to "
"Telem2/Serial2."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL_PASS2 <SERIAL_PASS2>` "
"设置为连接传感器的串行端口编号。例如，如果传感器连接到Telem2/Serial2，则设置为「2」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:29
#: fc76da3a3d2d4390a19118088403f7ea
msgid ""
"Press the \"Disconnect\" button on the ground station but leave the USB "
"cable from the PC to the autopilot connected."
msgstr "按地面站上的「Disconnect」（断开连接）按钮，但保持PC到飞控的USB电缆连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:31
#: c234cd6986b34f23bb2aaa5cfadf81a3
msgid ""
"some GCS do not have any easy means to \"Disconnect\" or will immediately "
"try to reconnect. In those cases just close the GCS application entirely."
msgstr "某些GCS没有简便的「断开连接」方式，或会立即尝试重连。这种情况下，直接关闭GCS应用程序即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:33
#: 017ed53035334ebbbb44734289e2f492
msgid ""
"Open the sensor's configuration software and connect to the autopilot's COM "
"port.  If all goes well the configuration software should work as it does "
"when the PC is directly connected to the sensor"
msgstr "打开传感器的配置软件，并连接到飞控的COM端口。如果一切正常，配置软件应如同PC直接连接到传感器一样工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:35
#: 3d2eb95b08984658a8c9b0b092f161c2
msgid "If the configuration fails to connect there are some things to try:"
msgstr "如果配置连接失败，可以尝试以下方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:37
#: e2502e461a654548bba6c0362c53bac7
msgid ""
"Some configuration software will not allow connecting to the autopilot's COM"
" port by default but may have a option to display all available COM ports"
msgstr "某些配置软件默认不允许连接到飞控的COM端口，但可能有选项可以显示所有可用的COM端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:38
#: efcafa13deb44ae2bc7315ff4beaf8a4
msgid ""
"If no serial messages are received from the PC the timeout will expire and "
":ref:`SERIAL_PASS2 <SERIAL_PASS2>` will revert to -1"
msgstr "如果PC没有收到串行消息，超时将过期，:ref:`SERIAL_PASS2 <SERIAL_PASS2>` 将恢复为-1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-passthrough.rst:41
#: 83ce9579756c41b8a5a4c102e7794a25
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"
